Under the Seafire Power Sponsored Research Project at the Department of Power Engineering, Jadavpur University, the monthly fellowship amount offered to student interns is as follows: 
- Junior Research Fellow (JRF): Rs. 38,440/- per month {Rs. 31,000 + HRA (24%)}
- Senior Research Fellow (SRF): Rs. 43,400/- per month {Rs. 35,000 + HRA (24%)}
